WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:06.120
At one time, gods and demons were as one.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.790
They were sealed away in the abyss of distant memory.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.830
The hearts of humans in fear of the Dark caused this.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.230
<i>Shinma: Japanese for “Gods-Demons”</i>

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.230
For the present, let us call these beings "Shinma".

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.790
Now they've awakened and gathered in the Dark.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.760
The final night of the gathering, when Shinma and humans met again,

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:34.470
a young girl entered their midst. This is her story. Her name is...

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:43.810
Vampire Princess Miyu

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:56.510
Episode 2
A Banquet of Marionettes

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:05.230
Oh, how cute!

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.580
Don't you think that Japanese dolls are kinda spooky?

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.640
Huh? Why?

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.760
Folks say the dolls' hair grows out, you know, that sort of thing...

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.040
Oh, come on!

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.200
<i>You’re suspended in time, too.</i>

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.840
She ain't here!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.890
Really! Where could she be?

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.540
— What a pain!
— The club room?

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.310
— Let's go see!
— Yeah!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:26.480
Missing?

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.170
Not again! This is creepy.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:33.240
They left for just a minute, and she vanished!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:40.360
That's... six missing boys and girls now, right? It's scary.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.660
Hey, she's watching him again!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.740
Yeah, and she just transferred here!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.900
Don't worry, there's no way Kei'll fall for her!

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:03.470
You always seem so... bored.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.120
I've been waiting for you.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.600
What about classes?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:09.310
What about them?

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.630
There they go again!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.300
Say, who's that girl?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:23.670
Oh, that upperclassman. I see her and Kei together a lot.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.880
Hmmm...

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.450
I'm jealous!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.000
I want to become one with you.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.330
Make me like someone from your world, soon.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:50.890
Don't rush, Kei. Do you want me to break my promise?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.950
Promise?

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:57.690
To make your beauty last forever...

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.760
You can?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:06.320
This body, which will rot away in a time not far from now...

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.350
Can you really?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:15.330
I told you I have that power... So don't rush me.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:33.270
Can you believe it, Larva?
This woman who steals my prey?

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.730
On top of which, she's Shinma!

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:41.750
I know... Shinma must be banished, right?

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.650
But I also need the blood of beautiful people.

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.210
<i>Kei?</i>

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.810
<i>Oh, hello, Kayo.</i>

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:16.020
<i>How are your studies?</i>

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:24.530
<i>Your mother thinks you might need a tutor, or something...</i>

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:29.830
<i>Kei? Hello?</i>

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.670
<i>Kei! How do you explain these grades?</i>

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>Try being more like your brother and sister!</i>

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.730
<i>You upset Mum again.</i>

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.100
<i>I can’t be like you.</i>

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:55.270
<i>No matter. We know we’ll be working at Dad’s company.</i>

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.360
<i>The company will do fine with just you there.</i>

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.060
<i>I just wanna get away from this house.</i>

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.550
<i>You’re spoiled because you’re the youngest.</i>

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:04.670
<i>Where’s Mother?</i>

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:09.640
<i>She’s out today. Need something? I’ll do it...</i>

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:14.580
<i>Give some thought to your future!</i>

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:37.340
<i>Kei! Your future is all set! Why are you fighting it?</i>

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.460
In other words, you want me to find someone?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:10.900
No, actually... how can I say it... a doll.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.010
A doll?

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:19.940
I said my daughter vanished from summer school, but...

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:26.970
the next day, I was restless so I went to the school, hoping there might be a clue.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:44.530
An art club student said she saw something strange...

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:46.730
just after my daughter disappeared.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.160
She saw a strange doll where my daughter should've been.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.910
The Police didn't take it seriously. Neither did anyone else.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:09:01.800
But... I feel that, somehow, that doll was my daughter.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:05.870
The doll disappeared all of a sudden.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.400
What do you think? I know this isn't much of a clue.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:15.780
But... I'm desperate enough to try even spiritualism.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:19.950
Your daughter... might've been turned into a doll, you think?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.250
Yes.

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:24.240
Please tell me where her school is.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:24.750
Certainly.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.630
I'm not sure whether this is a job for me, but...

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:36.290
<i>A girl changed into a doll... a strange case.</i>

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:42.460
<i>But the monsters called Shinma might be behind this incident.</i>

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:50.090
<i>And if there are Shinma, so must there be a certain vampire girl...</i>

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:07.120
No longer will you age or grow decrepit.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:12.350
You can live forever looking like you do now.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:20.720
And thus will your life energy become my sustenance...

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.380
Who's there?!

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.470
I am Miyu.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.400
The vampire that hunts us down!

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:34.690
I'm only returning stray Shinma to the Dark.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:40.660
Don't worry, I don't want to fight you just now.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:45.040
I only came to ask you something.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.150
Why don't you turn Yuzuki Kei into a doll?

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.200
You, who turns young people into dolls...

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.260
to bask in the lives sealed within.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.960
Why not him?

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.560
Stop that!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:09.830
I see, you have your eye on him too...

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:16.220
You've the wrong impression. I'm not interested in him.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.560
Kei approached me.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:25.290
He must've found out that I have powers normal people don't.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:29.340
He asked if I knew a way to preserve his beauty.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.590
I wonder if he wants to look like these, though!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.290
Larva!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:55.940
Shinma!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.500
When next we meet, I will ask you once more.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.910
Be ready with an answer to my question!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:14.070
Tell me, please, Kei. There's someone else, isn't there?

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:14.920
Yes.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.290
What kind of person is she?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.740
I'm not even sure if it is a person.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:39.980
Excuse me!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.080
Sorry about that. Thank you.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.410
Intriguing sketch.

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.580
Wow... what a cutie.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.630
Library{ Room}

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.510
Japanese Literature

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.840
Mind if I sit here?

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:10.990
Not at all...

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:23.360
I wouldn't go near that woman, if I were you.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.820
If you want eternal life, I can give it to you.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:35.100
If you want to live forever, as you are now, I know a way.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.210
I don't care about that.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:42.170
She knows nothing about eternal beauty!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.110
I don't know how you know...

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:51.070
but the promise is just an excuse to see her.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.360
I...

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:57.190
care about her.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:05.480
I love her. She's the only woman I desire.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:09.530
Even if she's not from this world... it's okay with me.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:32.230
Love? A human "loving" a Shinma?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.790
Excuse me, is that the faculty office over there?

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:45.610
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.780
Faculty Office

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:47.780
Pardon me.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:50.400
I need information on one of your...

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.700
students, as soon as possible...

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:22.810
I told you to leave me alone, Himiko.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:27.740
Are you after me? Or maybe a Shinma?

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:32.890
You... so that you can't victimise anyone else.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:37.790
I suppose your next target is that boy?

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:42.170
As always, a good-looking victim...

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:46.590
You're right. I desire beautiful people.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.810
So why are you just watching him?

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:52.010
Because I particularly like him.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:00.850
I've a present for you.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:12.320
Hmm... Holy water. Nice.

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:17.110
What are you? Sunlight has no effect on you...

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:21.090
and you scoff at crosses and holy water! Vampires like that...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.870
Do exist. You're looking at one.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.550
My name is Miyu.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.410
As the last vampire, I hunt the Shinma,

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:38.360
those who were once feared as gods, or even monsters.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:44.560
Living, for me, also means drinking human blood.

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:55.570
He is Larva, a Shinma bound to me after receiving my blood.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:02.130
Any more questions, Himiko?

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:06.000
Aren't you and the Shinma basically the same species?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.920
So why do you hunt them?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:17.590
Don't tell me you protect humans? That can't be true...

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:21.970
A strange underclassman is nosing around.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.560
I don't care about eternal beauty.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:29.190
Take me to a place where we'll be together forever.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.110
Even if my looks change, it wouldn't matter.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:36.830
Stop it! I'm... I'm...

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:41.230
I know... and it's okay.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.290
I... love you.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.290
"Protect humans?" Hmph.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:59.440
Everything changed the day I learned of my vampire blood.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:05.890
As duty demands, I send them back to their proper world.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:11.270
You see, my kind has been doing it for generations.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.650
Your "duty"?

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:17.610
It's none of your concern.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.670
No, Kei...

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.710
Miyu... are you after that boy?

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.810
Or a new Shinma?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.080
Why this school?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.350
Both...

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.900
I'm both hunter and vampire.

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.970
Hello, Miyu.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:34.810
First, give him to me. Then I'll return you to the Dark.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.320
Shinma... Ranka.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:01.630
Larva!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.420
I've no use for a man like this.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.060
Though neither will I give him to a greedy, grasping girl...

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.330
Kei?

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:16.540
Kei!

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:29.760
Larva!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.160
Take a good look.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:57.100
The man who loved you will receive my blood, and gain eternal life.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:32.580
You asked me why I didn't turn Kei into a doll...

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:35.250
Here's the answer!

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:40.080
I loved a human being even though I'm a Shinma...

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:43.500
I fell in love with Kei...

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:49.180
So I couldn't turn him into a doll, existing but not living.

00:22:50.230 --> 00:22:52.570
Shinma and humans are different...

00:22:52.570 --> 00:22:58.520
I tried to forget about love... but I was wrong to do so.

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:13.460
Kei...

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:21.450
Well, Miyu?

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:27.680
Can you love this beautiful man, now that he looks like this?

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:33.390
Can you drink his blood?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:46.590
I can love him, in this form.
He's mine, all mine...

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:36.740
Return the Shinma to the Dark!

00:24:50.170 --> 00:24:53.300
You lost, Miyu.

00:24:53.750 --> 00:24:59.160
I sent the Shinma, Ranka, back to the Dark where it belongs.

00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:01.180
I didn't lose.

00:25:02.830 --> 00:25:06.600
Not as the Hunter... I mean the woman within you.

00:25:10.830 --> 00:25:12.190
Larva...
